### Demonstrates entity(ParameterizedTypeReference) on a plain scalar list
GET http://localhost:8080/teams?group=A

### Demonstrates entity(ParameterizedTypeReference) with native structured output (per call)
GET http://localhost:8080/venues?city=Dallas

### Demonstrates responseEntity(ParameterizedTypeReference)
GET http://localhost:8080/fixtures?team=Morocco&stage=group stage

### Demonstrates responseEntity(Class)
GET http://localhost:8080/featured-match?stage=quarter-finals

### Demonstrates entity(Class) with schema validation
GET http://localhost:8080/players?name=Kylian Mbappé

### Demonstrates entity(Class) with a custom converter. This will initially fail with 500 error code, update the endpoint by enabling commented code to resolve the 500 http error code.
GET http://localhost:8080/matches/result?fixture=Morocco vs Haiti

### Demonstrates entity(Class) with schema validation and a custom converter together
GET http://localhost:8080/matches/stats?fixture=Morocco vs Haiti

### Demonstrates entity(ParameterizedTypeReference) with schema validation: the technique from {@code /players} applied to a collection instead of a single record
GET http://localhost:8080/referees

### Demonstrates entity(Class) with schema validation failures, check logs and filter by 'JSON validation failed'
GET http://localhost:8080/referee?name=Abdulrahman Al-Jassim

### Demonstrates responseEntity(ParameterizedTypeReference) with a custom converter and schema validation
GET http://localhost:8080/groups/standings?group=A

### Demonstrates responseEntity(ParameterizedTypeReference) with schema validation
GET http://localhost:8080/teams/journey?team=Morocco

### Demonstrates entity(ParameterizedTypeReference) with a custom converter, This will initially fail with 500 error code, update the endpoint by enabling commented code to resolve the 500 http error code.
GET http://localhost:8080/players/leaderboard?category=goals

### Demonstrates responseEntity(ParameterizedTypeReference) with native structured output (per call)
GET http://localhost:8080/news?team=Iran
